Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,0,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.30,0:00:05.06,Episode Title,,0,0,0,0,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1000,3900,4740)\pos(640,441.333)}Episode 82 \N\N\N\N\NNine campaigns on the Central Plains
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.51,0:00:06.49,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the winter of 262, Jiang Wei assembled an army,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.49,0:00:10.82,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,petitioning to the Latter Lord\N to invade the central plains a ninth time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.69,0:00:16.23,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,This time, Jiang Wei learned from the previous eight expeditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.23,0:00:19.80,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He planned to attack weak areas while avoiding strong areas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.80,0:00:23.09,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He would first seize Taoyang, and afterwards,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:29.40,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,he would accumulate food and ally \Nwith the Qiang peoples as the long-term plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.40,0:00:34.08,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Unexpectedly, Deng Ai predicted \Nthis plan, and defeated Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.26,0:00:32.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,9000,9000)\pos(954.667,496)}Zhāng Yì\NStyled: Bógōng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.08,0:00:37.71,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Xiahou Ba died fighting in Taoyang city.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:42.05,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,On one side, Jiang Wei was fighting Deng Ai at Taoyang;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.05,0:00:46.95,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,on the other, he secretly sent Zhang Yi \Nback to attack the nine camps at Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.96,0:01:02.53,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.94,0:01:25.94,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.10,0:01:35.63,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,We swear our survival alongside the nine camps!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.52,0:02:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Deng Ai is reinforcing us!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:03.62,Style Names,Shī Zuǎn,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,9000,9000)\pos(396,281.333)}Shī Zuǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:06.38,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2020,2420)\pos(944,429.333)}Dèng Ài\NStyled: Shìzài
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.00,0:02:05.41,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.14,0:02:22.60,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,The rear shall take the front! \NWe shall form a crescent formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.29,0:02:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Jiang Wei is attacking us from our rear with a large army!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.92,0:02:45.26,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Split our forces to defend!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.26,0:02:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:47.28,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Go, advance!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.78,0:03:01.02,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2900,3220)\pos(380,454.667)}Jiāng Wéi\NStyled: Bóyuē
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:00.65,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.91,0:03:09.37,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.28,0:04:41.71,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Who approaches?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,General.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.60,0:05:00.10,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,The nine camps are in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:06.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4940,5300)\pos(756,338.667)}Dèng Zhōng
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.54,0:05:04.44,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,We shall assemble the routed troops,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.44,0:05:06.91,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,to break through the siege and reinforce Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:08.75,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,It is easy to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:12.10,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,However, even if we get to the nine camps,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:15.99,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,we will not be able to help \Nbecause of how weakened we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.28,0:05:23.47,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,The only solution now is to go to Taoyang and gather reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.47,0:05:26.26,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,But distant water cannot put out a nearby fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.16,0:05:38.68,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Then you must move day and night to retrieve reinforcements, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.68,0:05:39.54,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:41.03,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:47.39,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,I shall gather my units and skirmish with the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.26,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,I wish to accompany you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.78,0:05:53.69,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.04,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.24,0:05:57.19,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.92,0:06:00.67,Default,Dèng Zhōng,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:56.48,Default,Shī Zuǎn,0,0,0,,Grand General, the warriors are ready to attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:07.72,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,We must have the nine camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:10.94,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Tonight, we take Mount Qi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.94,0:07:13.93,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, we march for Chang'an!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.89,0:07:20.08,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,We have served the Han Dynasty well and made great achievements today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.48,0:07:23.78,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Advance the troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.02,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, His Majesty's edict has arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The messenger is already in the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Receive the edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"... We believe that as the nine expeditions have toiled the army,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"and the campaigns made the people resentful,"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.89,0:08:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"the Grand General is to return to Hanzhong for now."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.47,0:08:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"He is to organize an army for a later campaign."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}"Thus We decree."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.08,0:08:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, receive thy edict.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.87,0:08:28.44,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,Grand General, the warriors await your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.54,0:08:35.15,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,The enemy camps cannot withstand\N one more attack! We must not lose this chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:04.42,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,Grand General, please give your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.83,0:09:07.45,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,General Zhang, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, please give your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:20.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, please give your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.22,0:09:31.26,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Officers, soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.19,0:09:33.50,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.34,0:09:42.02,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Officers, soldiers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:45.51,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.51,0:09:46.90,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.32,0:09:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:06.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, give your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.09,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Give your orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.36,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty's order has come!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, receive the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.24,0:10:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General, receive the order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.90,0:10:47.42,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,When campaigning, a general \Ndoes not have to obey his lord's orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:57.29,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Even so,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.38,0:11:05.45,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,His Majesty has sent numerous edicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.41,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,How can we disobey him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.97,0:11:17.49,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,{\bord12}You are fulfilling the dying wishes of Marquis Zhuge, accomplishing difficult deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.49,0:11:23.58,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your nine expeditions have been criticized by the court and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.59,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}But now, Deng Ai is trapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.19,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}We are on the verge of victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:33.74,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If we withdraw, then Marquis Zhuge's dying wishes...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.27,0:11:37.58,Default,Zhāng Yì,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}How can we not realize his hopes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.73,0:11:44.10,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}We have lost our momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.34,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}How can we force it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.48,0:11:50.06,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Without our liege behind us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.06,0:11:54.91,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}then even if we seize the nine camps at Mount Qi, what more can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.17,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Send my order.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.17,0:12:06.09,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Beat the drums for advancing, make it as though we are victorious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.74,0:12:12.64,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Withdraw our army in secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.43,0:12:57.80,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Grand General, everyone has left. Let us withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:07.07,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I will withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.98,0:13:34.66,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.23,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,The horse is not at fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:51.86,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Let us go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.89,0:14:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General Jiang Wei awaits your orders outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to meet with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,9000,9000)\pos(304,452)}Líu Shàn\NStyled: Gōngsì
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.22,0:14:30.80,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,We will not see him, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.80,0:14:31.31,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.31,0:14:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,As His Majesty is not attending court, how could he meet? Scram!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:38.11,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Indeed, We are not attending \Ncourt, so how could We meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is not attending court today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is not attending court today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.66,0:15:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,His Majesty is not attending court today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.38,0:15:36.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,9000,9000)\pos(989.333,513.333)}Xì Zhèng\NStyled: Lìngxiān
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.52,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.50,0:15:41.25,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,The Emperor has not been in court for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:49.03,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Mister Xi Zheng, His Majesty has sent me three edicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.03,0:15:52.60,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,They bade me to come back to court, and yet he is not seeing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:56.53,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,What is the reason behind this? Please, inform me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:15:58.05,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.15,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.31,0:16:07.58,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Eunuch Huang Hao wanted General \NYan Yu to distinguish himself on the battlefield,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:09.60,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,so he replaced you with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:13.48,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Therefore, he told His Majesty to recall you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.48,0:16:16.38,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Later, when Deng Ai's talent at using troops was known,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.38,0:16:20.34,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Yan Yu did not dare take up \Ncommand, so he gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:24.15,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I will kill that eunuch!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.32,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Do not, do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.32,0:16:27.40,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Sir, you are continuing the Marquis' work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.40,0:16:30.09,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,You carry a heavy load on a long road, you cannot be reckless.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.46,0:16:34.78,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,If His Majesty does not tolerate you, nothing can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.47,0:16:41.84,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,You are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:58.82,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Your subjects greet Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.14,0:17:17.66,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I have gone on nine expeditions, scoring victory after victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.66,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I have already trapped Deng Ai at Mount Qi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.66,0:17:23.72,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Yet, Your Majesty has sent\N three edicts ordering me to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.72,0:17:26.21,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I do not know your reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.03,0:17:31.44,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I heard that the vile Huang Hao abuses power,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:33.22,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,all too similar to the Ten Eunuchs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.22,0:17:37.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,0,3620,3980)\pos(958.667,489.333)}Huáng Hào
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.93,0:17:37.98,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Sire, reflect on what happened \Nto Zhang Rang, and eliminate that man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.98,0:17:42.26,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Then the court can be purified\N and we can restore the central plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.03,0:17:44.71,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Ministers, please rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.43,0:17:49.49,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Huang Hao is but a petty servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.49,0:17:53.08,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Even if he abuses power, \Nwhat is the worst he can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:55.30,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Ministers, why are you so suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.32,0:18:01.11,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, if you do not kill \NHuang Hao now, disaster will fall upon us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.17,0:18:07.66,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,To help one live is an act of love, to slay one is an act of hate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:10.46,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,How come you cannot tolerate a mere eunuch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.64,0:18:13.18,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Bring Huang Hao.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.18,0:18:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:25.56,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.19,0:18:36.16,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,Grand General.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.16,0:18:40.74,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,I attend to His Majesty morning and night, but I dare not to meddle in politics!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.74,0:18:44.89,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,General, do not believe the rumors and kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.89,0:18:49.10,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,My petty life is entirely in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:53.31,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,I hope you can take pity!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.77,0:18:59.98,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Good. The Grand General has forgiven you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.98,0:19:01.38,Default,Líu Shàn,0,0,0,,Thank him for his grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:03.52,Default,Huáng Hào,0,0,0,,Many thanks, Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:11.85,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Grand General, even though you got rid of your anger,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:14.93,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,you did not know that you were about to be in great trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:19.51,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,General, if you were endangered, \Nthen Shu-Han would be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:21.78,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,That is cause for concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.21,0:19:28.30,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Sir, please teach me a plan that \Ncan protect this nation and myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:33.06,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,There is a place in Longxi called Tazhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.42,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,Right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.42,0:19:42.28,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,It is a very fertile place.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.28,0:19:47.67,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,As its population is few, you should follow the example of Marquis Zhuge and garrison fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:51.69,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,You would petition the Emperor to\N advance to Tazhong to garrison fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.10,0:19:55.18,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Please explain, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.18,0:19:57.88,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Garrisoning fields at Tazhong has four benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:20:01.06,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The first: when the wheat ripens, \Nyou can add them to your food supply.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:03.81,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The second: you can capture \Nthe commanderies of the Longyou area.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.81,0:20:09.40,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The third: the people of Wei\N would not dare look solely at Hanzhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:14.96,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\}The fourth: if you stay on the frontier, you still hold military power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.96,0:20:18.55,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}No one could plot against you, \Nthus avoiding calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.55,0:20:22.69,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This is the plan that will protect this nation and yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.69,0:20:24.61,Default,Xì Zhèng,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Make your move soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.42,0:20:29.21,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,A good plan, a good plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.24,0:20:35.47,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Your words are like gold and jade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:51.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei garrisoned fields to avoid trouble, setting up over forty tents at Tazhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:55.63,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,There was no disruption in communication; they were like a long serpent.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.99,0:21:01.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,When a major general of Wei, \NDeng Ai, heard of this, he drafted plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.90,0:21:06.75,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He then sent them to the Duke of Jin, Sima Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.20,0:21:18.25,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Excellencies and Ministers,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.22,0:21:24.78,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The General who Conquers the West, Deng Shizai, has just sent a petition.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.78,0:21:28.48,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Jiang Wei of Shu-Han has garrisoned at Tazhong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:32.03,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}That man keeps on invading the central plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:34.91,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}We have not yet eliminated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.91,0:21:38.12,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}He is an insidious threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.88,0:21:44.51,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Gentlemen, do you have any wise plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.44,0:21:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Jiang Wei is garrisoning at Tazhong to avoid trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.15,0:21:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Lord of Shu Liu Shan indulges in wine \Nand women, and confides in Huang Hao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.19,0:21:59.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}His grand ministers are all demoralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.01,0:22:04.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Thus, should we invade Shu at this time, we will be triumphant.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.38,0:22:07.60,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}What true words!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.60,0:22:13.23,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12)}I intend to conquer Shu, but I need someone to serve as the general.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.23,0:22:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Deng Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.52,0:22:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Deng Shizai is the worthy talent of this era.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.45,0:22:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12} If Zhong Hui is made deputy general, they will accomplish great things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.72,0:22:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Stop there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.58,0:22:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Jiang Wei has invaded us many times, \Ncausing many losses among our armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.06,0:22:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Even with firm defenses,\N resistance is difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.81,0:22:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Why enter those arduous terrains just to harm ourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.94,0:22:35.91,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.65,0:22:42.99,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I am mustering a righteous host {\bord12}to slay a wicked leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:47.20,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}And you would dare stop me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.22,0:22:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.98,0:22:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.96,0:22:52.92,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Take him out of here and behead him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.21,0:22:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}You traitorous baseborn, inviter of chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.66,0:22:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Heaven will not tolerate you murdering the innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.39,0:23:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Heaven will punish you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.02,0:23:05.55,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Since my conquests of the east, for six years I have rested.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.32,0:23:10.66,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The preparations for soldiers and armor have been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.96,0:23:15.65,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}We have long wanted to conquer Wu and Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.65,0:23:22.94,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now, we will first destroy \Nthe Shu, then sail through the rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.94,0:23:26.08,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and advance our troops by water and land to seize Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:33.86,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This is the way of \Ndestroying Guo and taking Yu!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:33.86,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Names of ducal states during the Spring and Autumn era. The state of Jin destroyed Guo, then seized Yu upon their return.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.66,0:23:47.30,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5300,5620)\pos(749.333,497.333)}Zhōng Huì\NStyled: Shìjì
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.79,0:24:18.66,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the fourth year of the \NJingyuan era of Wei, or the year 263 CE,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.66,0:24:22.21,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sima Zhao named the General-who-\NGarrisons-the-West, Zhong Hui,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.21,0:24:25.58,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,as commanding officer of the Guanzhong region.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.58,0:24:32.06,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He dispatched troops from Qing, Xu, Ying, Yu,\N Jing, and Yang provinces.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.06,0:24:34.16,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The General-who-Conquers-the-West, Deng Ai, was ordered
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:36.94,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,to command troops outside the passes and of the Long region.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:39.09,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,They would conquer Shu on a set date.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.95,0:24:45.65,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,My lord, you have sent Zhong Hui to command a host of 100,000 to conquer Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.65,0:24:51.72,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,As I see it, his ambition reaches far.\NYou cannot let him have that much authority!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.46,0:24:54.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,2260,2620)\pos(946.667,429.333)}Sīmǎ Zhāo\NStyled: Zǐshàng
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:24:59.98,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,How could I not know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.91,0:25:05.92,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,My lord, why have you not ordered\N for someone else to share power with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.13,0:25:15.57,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The ministers have all \Nsaid we should not attack Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.11,0:25:18.37,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}This is because they are timid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.60,0:25:24.38,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If we force them to fight, they will be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.38,0:25:29.38,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Zhong Hui was the only advocate for conquering Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.38,0:25:31.56,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}This is because he is not timid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.56,0:25:35.82,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}And because of that, Shu will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.58,0:25:40.66,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}If Shu is destroyed, its people will be heartbroken.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.34,0:25:46.41,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}A general of a defeated army will not talk of valor.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.41,0:25:50.94,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}A minister of a lost nation will not plan for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:56.08,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Even if Zhong Hui intends to rebel, would the people of Shu aid him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.08,0:26:01.68,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}When our army triumphs, they will submit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.68,0:26:05.64,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}They will not follow Zhong Hui in rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.72,0:26:10.88,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,670)}Considering all of that, what is there to worry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.48,0:26:18.70,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,My lord, you are sagacious and wise, speaking with absolute genius.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.70,0:26:18.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,9000,9000)\pos(329.333,485.333)}Shào Tì\NStyled: Yuánbó
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.68,0:26:23.36,Default,Sīmǎ Zhāo,0,0,0,,You must not speak of this to outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.36,0:26:24.53,Default,Shào Tì,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.68,0:26:36.84,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Wei major general Zhong Hui led his \Ntroops southwards, advancing steadily.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:42.89,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Shu general Jiang Wei hurriedly wrote a report to the Lord of Shu, Liu Shan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.89,0:26:47.93,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Yet Liu Shan believed in sorcerers, and did not prepare for war.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.93,0:26:51.69,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Huang Hao repeatedly hid \Nemergency reports of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.69,0:26:55.69,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,The area of Hanzhong was lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.25,0:27:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.50,0:27:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Huang Hao has deceived the Emperor, he heeds words of soothsayers and has not sent troops!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.84,0:27:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Now Hanzhong has fallen and Yang'an Pass has been captured by Zhong Hui!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.67,0:27:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We got news that you were trapped \Nby Deng Ai, so we came to rescue you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.98,0:27:20.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3500,3860)\pos(301.333,490.667}Liào Huà\NStyled: Yuánjiǎn
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:23.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can only go to one place now: Baishui Pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.15,0:27:25.38,Default,Liào Huà,0,0,0,,No, the enemy has surrounded us on all sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.38,0:27:27.53,Default,Liào Huà,0,0,0,,We have no food supplies or reinforcements.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.53,0:27:30.57,Default,Liào Huà,0,0,0,,Better to retreat to Jiange and plan from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.05,0:28:33.01,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Men, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.01,0:28:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, general!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.48,0:28:49.96,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.32,0:28:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We are at Mount Dingjun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.74,0:28:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where General\N Xiahou Yuan was killed in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.15,0:29:04.07,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Is there a spirit shrine on Mount Dingjun?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.07,0:29:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no spirit shrine, but \Nthere is Marquis Zhuge's grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.87,0:30:06.78,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,I am Zhuge Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.78,0:30:09.18,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,I speak to you now in disjointed words.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.18,0:30:13.17,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,The Han dynasty has declined,\N the Mandate of Heaven is showing no favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.17,0:30:18.66,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,and the people of the region have \Nsuffered from warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.09,0:30:21.35,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,I hope that after you pass through the borders,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.35,0:30:23.49,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,you will not harm any person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.33,0:30:27.75,Thinking,Zhuge Liang/Kongming,0,0,0,,You will not harm any person.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.87,0:30:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.86,0:30:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-I did not hear anything.\N-It was silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.05,0:30:40.59,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Where is General Dong?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.69,0:30:42.54,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,General Dong!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.32,0:30:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.25,0:30:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.37,0:30:51.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Huang Hao abused his power and His Majesty does not listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.45,0:30:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's why we lost Hanzhong!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.96,0:31:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that a mighty foe approaches, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.14,0:31:02.70,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Do not worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:07.64,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,As long as I breathe, I will never allow Wei to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.78,0:31:14.44,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,We will defend Jiange for now and \Nthen find a way to repel the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.06,0:31:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The pass can be defended, but there is no one in Chengdu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:20.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If the enemy attacks it,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.19,0:31:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then we lose all momentum.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.15,0:31:29.66,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Chengdu has treacherous terrain and\Nsteep mountains. It will be hard to assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.66,0:31:31.76,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Please be at ease, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.06,0:31:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Report!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.01,0:31:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Grand General,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.84,0:31:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Overseer Zhuge Xu of Yong is leading troops to attack the pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.93,0:31:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Defend the pass, no one leaves their station!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.41,0:31:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.04,0:31:40.82,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Halt.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.01,0:31:47.48,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Zhuge Xu is a pathetic pest!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.42,0:31:56.54,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I wanted to take back Hanzhong, but he blocked my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.54,0:32:01.96,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I set up camp at the mountain base, but he stationed his troops at the bridgehead to trap me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:06.89,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,I used a trick to transfer him to \NYong Province, but he came to Jiange!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.30,0:32:11.96,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,This time, I will personally go out and fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.78,0:32:30.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3460,3860)\pos(274.667,314.667)}Zhūgé Xù
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.45,0:32:29.56,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei, you used a trick to escape Yinping Bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.56,0:32:31.46,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,Now our grand army is invading!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.46,0:32:34.63,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,Why not dismount and surrender? \NWhat are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.90,0:32:38.22,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,Zhuge Xu, you lowly traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.17,0:32:41.77,Default,Jiāng Wéi,0,0,0,,You dare go to your death again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.65,0:33:44.76,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I ordered you to guard Yinping Bridge to cut off Jiang Wei's return.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.76,0:33:47.55,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,How did you let him get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.55,0:33:51.19,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,You advanced on your own accord, leading to a defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.21,0:33:56.19,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,And you still have the face to return to camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.71,0:34:00.30,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei is a wily man!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.30,0:34:01.95,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,He looked like he was going for Yong!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.95,0:34:05.04,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,I was afraid Yong Province \Nwould be lost, so I went to reinforce it!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.04,0:34:07.41,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,Jiang Wei took advantage and escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.52,0:34:11.66,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,I wanted to atone for that, so I went to kill Jiang Wei.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.66,0:34:14.01,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,Somehow, I was defeated by him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.00,0:34:20.62,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Your many defeats have demoralized our army!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.62,0:34:21.45,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.45,0:34:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.87,0:34:24.80,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Take him out, execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.80,0:34:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.20,0:34:30.05,Default,Zhūgé Xù,0,0,0,,General, have mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.42,0:34:38.39,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Execute him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.39,0:34:39.32,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.54,0:34:45.62,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4700,5060)\pos(974.667,488)}Wèi Guàn\NStyled: Bóyù
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.22,0:34:42.91,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,Stay your blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:48.64,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Who stopped the punishment?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.47,0:34:54.76,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,I, Army Supervisor Wei Guan, request a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.14,0:35:00.70,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,What do you need to discuss, Army Supervisor Wei?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.70,0:35:04.41,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,Military law would not tolerate how negligent Zhuge Xu was in warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.41,0:35:09.40,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,However, he is a subordinate of General Deng Ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.40,0:35:14.52,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,If he is executed by you,\N I fear you will sow resentment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:20.58,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,I have been ordered by the Emperor and the Duke of Jin to conquer Shu!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.56,0:35:25.47,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,If Deng Ai was guilty, I would execute him without pardon!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.80,0:35:34.35,Default,Wèi Guàn,0,0,0,,General, please reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.76,0:35:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, General, reconsider this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.94,0:35:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, General, have mercy despite the law!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.12,0:35:42.13,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.52,0:35:47.05,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,In light of your requests, \NI shall exempt him from death.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.32,0:35:51.52,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Take Zhuge Xu to a prisoner cart!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.52,0:35:54.65,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Send him to Luoyang where he \Nmay be judged by the Duke of Jin!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.65,0:35:56.91,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,His troops shall obey my orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.03,0:36:02.98,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui is a pitiable bully!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.31,0:36:07.55,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,I share the same rank as him!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.55,0:36:10.65,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,I have guarded the frontier for a long time, toiling for our nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.65,0:36:15.15,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,If I had not trapped Jiang Wei\N at Tazhong, would he have any success?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.62,0:36:19.88,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Now he thinks so highly of himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.88,0:36:22.67,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,bullying my subordinates and slaying my soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.67,0:36:24.32,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Where is General Zhuge Xu now?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.86,0:36:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My general is being sent to Luoyang in a prisoner cart.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.14,0:36:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhong Hui also said... he also said...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.73,0:36:33.16,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,He said what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.84,0:36:40.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He also said that if you were guilty, \Nyou would be executed without pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.81,0:36:48.21,Default,Dèng Ài,0,0,0,,Prepare the horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.92,0:37:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Deng Ai has come before our camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.47,0:37:03.59,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Where is he now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.59,0:37:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He is outside the camp gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.64,0:37:08.35,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,How many people has he brought with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.35,0:37:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Over ten people.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.94,0:37:18.72,Default,Zhong Hui,0,0,0,,Have three hundred guards to be on\N high alert, inside and outside the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.72,0:37:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Comment: 0,0:26:36.84,0:26:42.89,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Audio is missing from frame 40025 to 40073.

